    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d523">

                <pb facs="0601" n="521" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg521"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Lord
                            Pauncefote</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-05-09"><hi rendition="#italic">May 9,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">Personal]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: I beg to thank you for
                    your personal note of the 3d instant, and to inclose for your information a copy
                    of an instruction<anchor n="a" xml:id="d523-f1"/> which I have sent to Mr.
                    Choate, directing him to formally request Lord Lansdowne to instruct His
                    Majesty’s agent at Sofia to take charge of United States interests in Bulgaria,
                    as before.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
